# --- SULFUR Build Calculator ---
# This repo IS the public GitHub-Pages deploy surface. Commit ONLY what the
# browser needs to run the site. Everything below stays LOCAL (rebuild as needed,
# see WIKI_CONTEXT.md) and is intentionally NOT deployed.
#
# Runtime files that ARE committed: index.html, styles.css, app.js,
# data.js (generated), and assets/weapons/*.png (the icons the site loads).

node_modules/
*.log
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# build + preview tooling (not needed to run the deployed site)
build-data.mjs
tools/

# source data — compiled into data.js; the CSVs themselves are never served
references/

# assets: keep ONLY the weapon icons the site loads today. Everything else under
# assets/ (all other item categories, the ui/ sets, the manifests) stays LOCAL until
# it is actually wired into the site — then un-ignore that specific dir here.
assets/*
!assets/weapons/

# internal dev docs — kept local, never on the public site
SPEC_PLAN.md
WIKI_CONTEXT.md
Progress.md
README.md

# the datamine workspace lives as a SIBLING and is never committed here
_*_extract/
